The [[Bow and Arrow]] is a [[weapon]] available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s. It does mild-moderate damage, but deals more damage every time the {{icon/star}} weapon at its tip deals damage. Despite its larger size, it costs the same stamina per second as the [[Shortbow]]. 

There are three [[Bow and Arrow]] upgrades.

The [[Tusk Piercer]] can be crafted by combining the [[Bow and Arrow]] with a [[Walrus Tusk]]. It gives the player {{icon/spikes}}, but spends {{icon/spikes}} to increase the damage of its attacks when the {{icon/star}} weapon hits.

The [[Fortuna's Grace]] can be crafted by combining the [[Bow and Arrow]] with two [[Lucky Clover]]s. It deals the least damage of any of the upgrades, but gives the player {{icon/luck}}, and attacks twice when the {{icon/star}} weapon crits, which synergizes nicely with the [[Ranger Bag]]. 

The [[Belladonna's Whisper]] can be crafted by combining the [[Bow and Arrow]] with a [[Pestilence Flask]]. It deals the most damage of any of the upgrades, and also scales off of the {{icon/poison}} of the opponent, while inflicting {{icon/poison}} proportional to the damage of the {{icon/star}} weapon.
